msgid "The Kitten in the Boathouse"
msgstr "La gattina nella rimessa"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/018_the_kitten_in_the_boathouse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your kitten is gone! She did not come for her milk this morning. Ask the boats on the lakes if "
"anyone has seen her."
msgstr ""
"La {crew|tua|tua|vostra} gattina è sparita! Stamattina non è venuta a bere il latte. "
"{crew|Chiedi|Chiedi|Chiedete} alle barche sui laghi se qualcuno l'ha vista."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/018_the_kitten_in_the_boathouse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A grey kitten? I saw one jump off a boat at Kråkhamn, by the boathouse!"
msgstr ""
"Una gattina grigia? Ne ho vista una saltare giù da una barca a Kråkhamn, vicino alla rimessa delle"
" barche!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/018_the_kitten_in_the_boathouse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A grey kitten? No... but cats love warm, quiet places with wood shavings."
msgstr ""
"Una gattina grigia? No... ma i gatti adorano i posti caldi e tranquilli, con i trucioli di legno."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/018_the_kitten_in_the_boathouse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In my boathouse, in the wood shavings: your kitten! And four tiny kittens of her own! You can take"
" them all home in a basket."
msgstr ""
"Nella mia rimessa, tra i trucioli: la {crew|tua|tua|vostra} gattina! E con lei quattro gattini "
"piccolissimi! {crew|Puoi|Puoi|Potete} portarli tutti a casa in un cesto."

