#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/020_fog_on_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A fog has fallen, and my children Ivar and Märta rowed out to the islands this morning! Old "
"Halvard knows the islands best. Please find them!"
msgstr ""
"È scesa la nebbia, e stamattina i miei bambini Ivar e Märta sono andati in barca alle isole! Il "
"vecchio Halvard conosce le isole meglio di tutti. Per favore, {crew|trovali|trovali|trovateli}!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/020_fog_on_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In this fog? Listen... I heard children's voices by Bergö, the island of the potter. Row there, "
"slowly!"
msgstr ""
"Con questa nebbia? {crew|Ascolta|Ascolta|Ascoltate}... Ho sentito voci di bambini vicino a Bergö, "
"l'isola della vasaia. {crew|Rema|Rema|Remate} fin lì, piano!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/020_fog_on_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"They were sitting by my kiln to keep warm. Here, take them home, they are not hurt, only cold."
