#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/026_clay_for_the_potter/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My island has no clay left! The best clay is on the shore of Ekvik. Bring me four baskets, and you"
" get two crates of my pots."
msgstr ""
"Sulla mia isola non c'è più argilla! L'argilla migliore è sulla riva di Ekvik. "
"{crew|Portamene|Portamene|Portatemene} quattro cesti, e {crew|avrai|avrai|avrete} due casse dei "
"miei vasi."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/026_clay_for_the_potter/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Grey, sticky clay from the shore. Heavy too!"
msgstr "Argilla grigia e appiccicosa dalla riva. E pesante!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/026_clay_for_the_potter/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Lovely clay! Squeeze it, smell it... Here are your pots, still warm from the kiln."
msgstr ""
"Che bella argilla! Da stringere, da annusare... Ecco i {crew|tuoi|tuoi|vostri} vasi, ancora caldi "
"di forno."

