#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bees for Solby"
msgstr "Api per Solby"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My apple trees bloom, but no bee visits them! Without bees, no apples. Buy a beehive from Alfhild "
"in Dimmberga and bring it to my orchard."
msgstr ""
"I miei meli sono in fiore, ma nessuna ape li visita! Senza api, niente mele. "
"{crew|Compra|Compra|Comprate} un'arnia da Alfhild a Dimmberga e {crew|portala|portala|portatela} "
"nel mio frutteto."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Listen to them hum! Now the flowers will become apples. Take these flowers for your farm."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Senti|Senti|Sentite} come ronzano! Ora i fiori diventeranno mele. "
"{crew|Prendi|Prendi|Prendete} questi fiori per la {crew|tua|tua|vostra} fattoria."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bees carry the pollen from flower to flower, so that the fruits grow."
msgstr "Le api portano il polline da un fiore all'altro, così crescono i frutti."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Lost Lamb"
msgstr "L'agnellina smarrita"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"One of the lambs from the cold night is gone! The little one with the black ear. Ask Freya and "
"Liv, they paddle everywhere in their canoe."
msgstr ""
"Uno degli agnellini della notte fredda è sparito! La piccola con l'orecchio nero. "
"{crew|Chiedi|Chiedi|Chiedete} a Freya e Liv: vanno dappertutto con la loro canoa."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A lamb with a black ear? We saw one on Laxön, eating Tova's flowers!"
msgstr ""
"Un'agnellina con l'orecchio nero? Ne abbiamo vista una a Laxön, che mangiava i fiori di Tova!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "She swam over! Can you imagine? She is wet but well. Take her home."
msgstr ""
"È arrivata a nuoto! {crew|Ci credi|Ci credi|Ci credete}? È bagnata ma sta bene. "
"{crew|Portala|Portala|Portatela} a casa."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Black Ear! She runs to her mother. Keep the other lamb of that ewe: she likes you."
msgstr ""
"Orecchio Nero! Corre dalla sua mamma. {crew|Tieni|Tieni|Tenete} l'altro agnellino di quella "
"pecora: {crew|ti|ti|vi} vuole bene."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
