#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/029_herbs_for_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Healers dried herbs in bundles under the roof, to have them all winter."
msgstr "Le guaritrici seccavano le erbe a mazzetti sotto il tetto, per averle tutto l'inverno."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/030_the_mill_turns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Mill Turns"
msgstr "Il mulino gira"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/030_the_mill_turns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The harvest is in, and the mill wheel turns day and night! But the farmers are slow. Bring me six "
"crates of grain to grind."
msgstr ""
"Il raccolto è finito, e la ruota del mulino gira giorno e notte! Ma i contadini sono lenti. "
"{crew|Portami|Portami|Portatemi} sei casse di grano da macinare."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/030_the_mill_turns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Six crates! Listen to the stones grind. Bjarne says hello, and here is your share."
msgstr ""
"Sei casse! {crew|Senti|Senti|Sentite} come macinano le pietre. Bjarne {crew|ti|ti|vi} saluta, ed "
"ecco la {crew|tua|tua|vostra} parte."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/030_the_mill_turns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Most vikings ground their grain by hand with two stones; a water mill was a wonder."
msgstr ""
"Quasi tutti i vichinghi macinavano il grano a mano con due pietre; un mulino ad acqua era una "
"meraviglia."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/031_a_henhouse_full/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Henhouse Full"
msgstr "Un pollaio pieno"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/031_a_henhouse_full/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Eggs sell so well! Let us have six hens. Buy hens at the market in Kråkhamn or the farm of "
"Frosttorp, and bring them home."
msgstr ""
"Le uova si vendono così bene! Prendiamo sei galline. {crew|Compra|Compra|Comprate} galline al "
"mercato di Kråkhamn o alla fattoria di Frosttorp, e {crew|portale|portale|portatele} a casa."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/031_a_henhouse_full/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Six hens! Cluck, cluck, scratch, scratch. Do not forget: they eat grain."
msgstr ""
"Sei galline! Coccodè, coccodè, raspa, raspa. Non {crew|dimenticare|dimenticare|dimenticate}: "
"mangiano il grano."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/031_a_henhouse_full/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Viking hens were small and laid fewer eggs than ours, but every farm had some."
msgstr ""
"Le galline vichinghe erano piccole e facevano meno uova delle nostre, ma ogni fattoria ne aveva "
"qualcuna."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey Cakes"
msgstr "Dolcetti al miele"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We want to sell honey cakes on the market! But we have no oven. Bring honey and grain to your "
"grandmother; she bakes them overnight, and you bring us the cakes."
msgstr ""
"Vogliamo vendere dolcetti al miele al mercato! Ma non abbiamo il forno. {crew|Porta|Porta|Portate}"
" miele e grano a {crew|tua|tua|vostra} nonna; lei li cuoce durante la notte, e poi {crew|ci "
"porti|ci porti|ci portate} i dolcetti."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey! Now the grain."
msgstr "Miele! Ora il grano."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "I bake them tonight. Come for them in the morning!"
msgstr "Li cuocio stanotte. {crew|Vieni|Vieni|Venite} a prenderli domattina!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Still warm. Do not eat them all on the way!"
msgstr "Ancora caldi. Non {crew|mangiarli|mangiarli|mangiateli} tutti per strada!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "They smell so good! Everybody comes to our stall. Here, half the silver is yours."
msgstr ""
"Che profumo! Tutti vengono al nostro banco. Ecco, metà dell'argento è {crew|tua|tua|vostra}."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cakes"
msgstr "Dolcetti"

