#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Viking bread was flat and baked on hot stones; honey made it a treat."
msgstr "Il pane vichingo era piatto e cotto su pietre calde; con il miele diventava una delizia."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Chieftain's Feast"
msgstr "La festa del capo"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My daughter Thora turns twelve! A feast with the whole valley: bring me three crates of mead and "
"two of cheese, within three days."
msgstr ""
"Mia figlia Thora compie dodici anni! Una festa con tutta la valle: "
"{crew|portami|portami|portatemi} tre casse di idromele e due di formaggio, entro tre giorni."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The mead! The skalds will sing."
msgstr "L'idromele! Gli scaldi canteranno."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cheese, mead, songs and a fire! Come in, sit by me: it is the best birthday ever."
msgstr ""
"Formaggio, idromele, canzoni e un fuoco! {crew|Entra|Entra|Entrate}, "
"{crew|siediti|siediti|sedetevi} accanto a me: è il compleanno più bello di sempre."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A chieftain's hall had a long fire in the middle, and benches along the walls."
msgstr "La sala di un capo aveva un lungo fuoco nel mezzo, e panche lungo le pareti."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Ferryman's Tale"
msgstr "La storia di Halvard"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Old Halvard told a story here last night: a hidden cove, where the swans of the lakes are born. He"
" says: ask the potter, the miller and the old man of Svanetorp."
msgstr ""
"Ieri sera il vecchio Halvard ha raccontato una storia: una baia nascosta, dove nascono i cigni dei"
" laghi. Dice: {crew|chiedi|chiedi|chiedete} alla vasaia, alla mugnaia e al vecchio di Svanetorp."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The cove? My grandmother said: it lies where the reeds grow tallest. Ask Astrid."
msgstr ""
"La baia? Mia nonna diceva: è dove le canne crescono più alte. {crew|Chiedi|Chiedi|Chiedete} ad "
"Astrid."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Reeds? The tallest ones grow south, by Svanetorp. Go to Grim."
msgstr "Canne? Le più alte crescono a sud, vicino a Svanetorp. {crew|Va'|Va'|Andate} da Grim."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"So you found my secret. Behind my farm, in the reeds: the swan cove. Look, the cygnets! Grey and "
"fluffy. Tell no one!"
msgstr ""
"Allora {crew|hai|hai|avete} scoperto il mio segreto. Dietro la mia fattoria, tra le canne: la baia"
" dei cigni. {crew|Guarda|Guarda|Guardate}, i piccoli! Grigi e soffici. Non "
"{crew|dirlo|dirlo|ditelo} a nessuno!"

#. a gift for a task: 'You get ...'
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "the secret of the swan cove"
msgstr "il segreto della baia dei cigni"

#. the thing 'the secret of the swan cove' for {thing@acc} in the translations: the accusative (the
#. direct object), e.g. 'бочку эля', 'bačvu piva'; leave it empty if it is the same as the plain
#. translation
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
msgctxt "acc"
msgid "the secret of the swan cove"
msgstr ""

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Young swans are grey, not white; they are called cygnets."
msgstr "I cigni giovani sono grigi, non bianchi; si chiamano cignetti."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/035_wool_for_the_winter_cloth/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Wool for the Winter Cloth"
msgstr "Lana per l'inverno"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/035_wool_for_the_winter_cloth/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Everybody wants warm cloth for the winter, and my looms are hungry. Bring me four crates of wool, "
"and I give you a bolt of red cloth."
msgstr ""
"Tutti vogliono stoffa calda per l'inverno, e i miei telai hanno fame. "
"{crew|Portami|Portami|Portatemi} quattro casse di lana, e {crew|ti|ti|vi} do una pezza di stoffa "
"rossa."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/035_wool_for_the_winter_cloth/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Clack, clack, goes the loom. Here: the reddest cloth I ever made, for you."
msgstr ""
"Clac, clac, fa il telaio. Ecco: la stoffa più rossa che abbia mai fatto, per {crew|te|te|voi}."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/035_wool_for_the_winter_cloth/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The women of a viking farm wove all the cloth: sails, clothes and blankets."
msgstr "Le donne di una fattoria vichinga tessevano tutta la stoffa: vele, vestiti e coperte."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/036_flax_in_the_field/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flax in the Field"
msgstr "Lino nel campo"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/036_flax_in_the_field/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Linen is softer than wool on the skin. Plant flax on your farm! When it blooms blue and is ripe, "
"bring me two crates."
msgstr ""
"Il lino sulla pelle è più morbido della lana. {crew|Semina|Semina|Seminate} il lino nella "
"{crew|tua|tua|vostra} fattoria! Quando fiorisce blu ed è maturo, "
"{crew|portamene|portamene|portatemene} due casse."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/036_flax_in_the_field/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flax seed in the field. In a few days, it blooms blue."
