#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/037_barley_for_the_brewer/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Barley for the Brewer"
msgstr "Orzo per il birraio"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/037_barley_for_the_brewer/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Orm of Hallvik wants the biggest barrel of ale for the autumn feast. I need grain, five crates! "
"Bring them, and you get two crates of my ale."
msgstr ""
"Orm di Hallvik vuole il barile di birra più grande per la festa d'autunno. Mi serve grano, cinque "
"casse! {crew|Portamele|Portamele|Portatemele}, e {crew|avrai|avrai|avrete} due casse della mia "
"birra."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/037_barley_for_the_brewer/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Into the water with it, let it sprout... In a week, the best ale of the lakes!"
msgstr "Dentro l'acqua, e lasciamolo germogliare... Tra una settimana, la birra migliore dei laghi!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/037_barley_for_the_brewer/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ale was brewed from barley and water, often with herbs instead of hops."
msgstr "La birra si faceva con orzo e acqua, spesso con erbe al posto del luppolo."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/038_a_proper_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Proper Hold"
msgstr "Una stiva come si deve"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/038_a_proper_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You are real traders now: you need a real hold! Bring me eight planks from Frosttorp and two "
"crates of iron tools, and pay 20 silver. Then your hold takes two more crates."
msgstr ""
"Ora {crew|sei un vero mercante|sei una vera mercante|siete veri mercanti|siete vere mercanti}: "
"{crew|ti|ti|vi} serve una vera stiva! {crew|Portami|Portami|Portatemi} otto assi da Frosttorp e "
"due casse di attrezzi di ferro, e {crew|paga|paga|pagate} 20 argento. Così la "
"{crew|tua|tua|vostra} stiva porterà due casse in più."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/038_a_proper_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Planks of pine, split with wedges. Stack them well!"
msgstr "Assi di pino, spaccate con i cunei. {crew|Impilale|Impilale|Impilatele} bene!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/038_a_proper_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Good iron! Now my wages."
msgstr "Buon ferro! Ora la mia paga."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/038_a_proper_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Saw, plane, rivets... Look at her! Longer, wider, and room for two more crates."
msgstr ""
"Sega, pialla, chiodi... {crew|Guardala|Guardala|Guardatela}! Più lunga, più larga, e posto per due"
" casse in più."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
