#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Messenger's Cold"
msgstr "La messaggera malata"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Atchoo! I have a cold, and I must tell the smith, the horse farm and the herders about the autumn "
"feast at Hallvik. Can you do it today? Atchoo!"
msgstr ""
"Etciù! Ho il raffreddore, e devo avvisare il fabbro, l'allevamento di cavalli e i pastori della "
"festa d'autunno a Hallvik. {crew|Puoi farlo tu|Puoi farlo tu|Potete farlo voi} oggi? Etciù!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The autumn feast? I will bring my best knives to show."
msgstr "La festa d'autunno? Porterò i miei coltelli migliori da mostrare."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "We will come with all the horses! Tell Inga to drink hot honey water."
msgstr "Verremo con tutti i cavalli! {crew|Di'|Di'|Dite} a Inga di bere acqua calda col miele."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast! I will bring my flute. Thank you!"
msgstr "Una festa! Porterò il mio flauto. Grazie!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Messengers rowed, rode and ran: news could cross a land in a few days."
msgstr ""
"I messaggeri remavano, cavalcavano e correvano: una notizia poteva attraversare una terra in pochi"
" giorni."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/040_hay_for_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay for Frosttorp"
msgstr "Fieno per Frosttorp"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/040_hay_for_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My hay meadow was flooded, and the cows are hungry! I need eight crates of hay. Your big boat can "
"do it in one trip."
msgstr ""
"Il mio prato è stato allagato, e le mucche hanno fame! Mi servono otto casse di fieno. Con la "
"{crew|tua|tua|vostra} barca grande basta un viaggio."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/040_hay_for_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Moo! Listen to them, they are happy. You saved my winter. Take this cheese."
msgstr ""
"Muu! {crew|Senti|Senti|Sentite}, sono contente. {crew|Mi hai salvato|Mi hai salvato|Mi avete "
"salvato} l'inverno. {crew|Prendi|Prendi|Prendete} questo formaggio."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/040_hay_for_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay is dried grass; without enough of it, a farm could not keep its animals over winter."
msgstr ""
"Il fieno è erba secca; senza abbastanza fieno, una fattoria non poteva tenere gli animali "
"d'inverno."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sigvor's Cheese"
msgstr "Il formaggio di Sigvor"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My goats gave so much milk this summer! I made four big wheels of cheese for Orm's autumn feast in"
" Hallvik, but my boat is full of goats. Will you carry them?"
msgstr ""
"Quest'estate le mie capre hanno dato tanto latte! Ho fatto quattro grandi forme di formaggio per "
"la festa d'autunno di Orm a Hallvik, ma la mia barca è piena di capre. {crew|Puoi portarle tu|Puoi"
" portarle tu|Potete portarle voi}?"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sigvor's cheese! The guests will fight over it. Well, not fight: they will ask nicely."
msgstr ""
"Il formaggio di Sigvor! Gli ospiti se lo litigheranno. Be', non litigheranno: lo chiederanno per "
"favore."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Roll them in gently. And no nibbling!"
msgstr "{crew|Falle|Falle|Fatele} rotolare dentro piano. E niente assaggini!"

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cheese"
msgstr "Formaggio"

#. a thing of a task; {count|...|...} picks the form for the number {count} (one, then the others;
