#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/048_geese_for_the_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Geese for the Market"
msgstr "Oche per il mercato"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/048_geese_for_the_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The geese of Frosttorp are the fattest on the lakes. I want six for the market! Each goose takes a"
" crate, and they honk all the way."
msgstr ""
"Le oche di Frosttorp sono le più grasse dei laghi. Ne voglio sei per il mercato! Ogni oca occupa "
"una cassa, e starnazzano per tutto il viaggio."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/048_geese_for_the_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
