#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/053_the_lame_goat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Goats climb anything: rocks, roofs, and sometimes boats."
msgstr "Le capre si arrampicano dappertutto: rocce, tetti, e a volte barche."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Barley in Spring"
msgstr "Orzo in primavera"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The fields are dry: time to sow! Plant barley, and while it grows, sell two crates of eggs to Orm "
"in Hallvik to buy more seed."
msgstr ""
"I campi sono asciutti: è ora di seminare! {crew|Semina|Semina|Seminate} l'orzo, e mentre cresce "
"{crew|vendi|vendi|vendete} due casse di uova a Orm, a Hallvik, per comprare altri semi."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The barley is sown. Now the sun and the rain do the work."
msgstr "L'orzo è seminato. Ora il sole e la pioggia fanno il lavoro."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Eggs! I make my famous egg cake. Here, good silver for good eggs."
msgstr "Uova! Faccio la mia famosa torta di uova. Ecco, buon argento per buone uova."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Barley was the most important grain of the north: for bread, porridge and ale."
msgstr "L'orzo era il cereale più importante del nord: per il pane, la pappa e la birra."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Great Hold"
msgstr "La grande stiva"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now we make your boat great! Ten planks from Frosttorp, three crates of tools, and 30 silver. Then"
" she takes two more crates. Ten planks are more than you can carry at once."
msgstr ""
"Ora rendiamo grande la {crew|tua|tua|vostra} barca! Dieci assi da Frosttorp, tre casse di attrezzi"
" e 30 argento. Così porterà due casse in più. Dieci assi sono più di quante ne "
"{crew|puoi|puoi|potete} portare in una volta."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Planks again? Bjarne is building you a ship!"
msgstr "Ancora assi? Bjarne {crew|ti|ti|vi} sta costruendo una nave!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Iron for the rivets. Now my wages."
msgstr "Ferro per i chiodi. Ora la mia paga."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Two more crates! And go and see Signe in Ekvik: she builds real ships, and my crates go with you "
"into any of them."
msgstr ""
"Due casse in più! E {crew|va'|va'|andate} a trovare Signe a Ekvik: lei costruisce vere navi, e le "
"casse in più che ho fatto valgono anche su quelle."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A knarr, the cargo ship of the vikings, could carry the load of twenty boats."
msgstr "Un knarr, la nave da carico dei vichinghi, poteva portare il carico di venti barche."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bjørn's Salt Run"
msgstr "Il sale di Bjørn"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My boat leaks, and the fishers of Ekvik wait for salt! Take eight sacks for me from here to Ekvik."
" Your new hold is just right."
msgstr ""
"La mia barca fa acqua, e i pescatori di Ekvik aspettano il sale! {crew|Porta|Porta|Portate} otto "
"sacchi per me da qui a Ekvik. La {crew|tua|tua|vostra} stiva nuova è proprio giusta."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bjørn's salt, brought by you? Then I pay you, not him. Ha!"
msgstr "Il sale di Bjørn, portato da {crew|te|te|voi}? Allora pago {crew|te|te|voi}, non lui. Ah!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Eight sacks of the best salt from the sea. Keep them dry!"
msgstr "Otto sacchi del miglior sale di mare. {crew|Tienili|Tienili|Teneteli} all'asciutto!"

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
#, fuzzy
