msgid "The Canoe Race"
msgstr "La gara delle canoe"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Race us! Whoever touches the jetties of Ålberga, Dimmberga and Svanetorp first and comes back here"
" wins. Can you do it before the day ends?"
msgstr ""
"{crew|Sfidaci|Sfidaci|Sfidateci}! Vince chi tocca per primo i pontili di Ålberga, Dimmberga e "
"Svanetorp e torna qui. {crew|Ce la fai|Ce la fai|Ce la fate} prima che finisca il giorno?"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ålberga: touched! The canoe is right behind you!"
msgstr "Ålberga: toccato! La canoa è proprio dietro di {crew|te|te|voi}!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Dimmberga! Row, row, they are close!"
msgstr "Dimmberga! {crew|Rema, rema|Rema, rema|Remate, remate}, sono vicine!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Svanetorp! Now back to Kråkhamn!"
msgstr "Svanetorp! Ora di nuovo a Kråkhamn!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You won! But only by a nose. Next time we win! Here, the prize: a honey cake each, and silver."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Hai vinto|Hai vinto|Avete vinto}! Ma solo per un soffio. La prossima volta vinciamo noi! "
"Ecco il premio: un dolcetto al miele {crew|per te|per te|a testa}, e argento."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Vikings loved contests: rowing, swimming, wrestling and running."
msgstr "I vichinghi amavano le gare: remare, nuotare, lottare e correre."

