#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/061_the_swarm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Swarm"
msgstr "Lo sciame"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/061_the_swarm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My bees swarmed! A whole cloud of them flew off with a young queen, and Solveig says they hang in "
"her apple tree. Bring them this empty hive, and bring them back to me."
msgstr ""
"Le mie api hanno sciamato! Una nuvola intera è volata via con una giovane regina, e Solveig dice "
"che sono appese al suo melo. {crew|Porta|Porta|Portate} loro questa arnia vuota, e "
"{crew|riportamele|riportamele|riportatemele}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/061_the_swarm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "They hang there like a big brown pear! Hold the hive under them... shake... they are in!"
msgstr ""
"Sono appese lì come una grossa pera marrone! {crew|Tieni|Tieni|Tenete} l'arnia sotto di loro... "
"scuoti... sono dentro!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/061_the_swarm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My bees! Not one sting for you? Then they like you. Take two crates of honey."
msgstr ""
"Le mie api! Neanche una puntura? Allora {crew|ti|ti|vi} vogliono bene. "
"{crew|Prendi|Prendi|Prendete} due casse di miele."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/061_the_swarm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Row smoothly: a swarm is calm, as long as nobody bumps the hive."
msgstr "{crew|Rema|Rema|Remate} con calma: uno sciame è tranquillo, finché nessuno urta l'arnia."

