msgstr "Fieno per Ålberga"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/063_hay_for_alberga/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"So many lambs this spring! The ewes eat and eat, and my hay is gone. Bring me eight crates of hay "
"within two days."
msgstr ""
"Quanti agnelli questa primavera! Le pecore mangiano e mangiano, e il mio fieno è finito. "
"{crew|Portami|Portami|Portatemi} otto casse di fieno entro due giorni."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/063_hay_for_alberga/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Eight crates! The ewes munch, and the lambs jump around. Take a fleece of the softest wool."
msgstr ""
"Otto casse! Le pecore sgranocchiano, e gli agnelli saltellano. {crew|Prendi|Prendi|Prendete} un "
"vello della lana più morbida."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/063_hay_for_alberga/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A sheep eats about two kilograms of hay a day."
msgstr "Una pecora mangia circa due chili di fieno al giorno."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/064_the_ferrymans_last_trip/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Ferryman's Last Trip"
