#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/064_the_ferrymans_last_trip/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Old Halvard says his bones are too old for the oars. He wants to live with his daughter in Solby. "
"Will you row him there? He has stories for the whole way."
msgstr ""
"Il vecchio Halvard dice che le sue ossa sono troppo vecchie per i remi. Vuole andare a vivere da "
"sua figlia a Solby. {crew|Lo porti|Lo porti|Lo portate} lì in barca? Ha storie per tutto il "
"viaggio."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/064_the_ferrymans_last_trip/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Father! Come in, your chair by the fire is ready. Thank you for bringing him."
msgstr "Papà! Entra, la tua sedia accanto al fuoco è pronta. Grazie di avermelo portato."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/064_the_ferrymans_last_trip/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Old Halvard: Two young skippers for an old ferryman! Did I ever tell you about the sea serpent?"
msgstr ""
"Il vecchio Halvard: {crew|Un giovane capitano|Una giovane capitana|Due giovani capitani|Due "
"giovani capitane} per un vecchio traghettatore! {crew|Ti ho|Ti ho|Vi ho} mai raccontato del "
"serpente marino?"

