#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My horse Grane will not eat, and he is sad. Bring Tova to look at him, and take her home after."
msgstr ""
"Il mio cavallo Grane non mangia, ed è triste. {crew|Porta|Porta|Portate} qui Tova a visitarlo, e "
"poi {crew|riportala|riportala|riportatela} a casa."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tova: Just as I thought: a sore tooth. I file it smooth... There. Let him rest a night."
msgstr ""
"Tova: Proprio come pensavo: un dente che fa male. Lo limo per bene... Ecco. Lasciamolo riposare "
"una notte."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Not eating? Let me see his teeth."
msgstr "Non mangia? {crew|Fammi|Fammi|Fatemi} vedere i denti."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Back on my island. You were good assistants: soon you heal on your own."
msgstr ""
"Di nuovo sulla mia isola. {crew|Sei stato un bravo assistente|Sei stata una brava assistente|Siete"
" stati bravi assistenti|Siete state brave assistenti}: presto {crew|curerai|curerai|curerete} da "
"{crew|solo|sola|soli|sole}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Grane eats like a wolf again! Take Tova home, with my thanks."
msgstr ""
"Grane mangia di nuovo come un lupo! {crew|Riporta|Riporta|Riportate} Tova a casa, con i miei "
"ringraziamenti."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Horses' teeth grow all their life; sometimes they must be filed smooth."
msgstr "I denti dei cavalli crescono per tutta la vita; a volte bisogna limarli."

