#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Sunny Hill"
msgstr "La collina al sole"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My old aunt Gerd moves to Solby, to her sister. She owns the sunny hill by your farm, and says: "
"whoever rows me and my chests gets the hill! She has three chests."
msgstr ""
"La mia vecchia zia Gerd si trasferisce a Solby, da sua sorella. È sua la collina al sole vicino "
"alla {crew|tua|tua|vostra} fattoria, e dice: chi porta in barca me e i miei bauli avrà la collina!"
" Ha tre bauli."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Aunt Gerd's chests? Bring her too!"
msgstr "I bauli di zia Gerd? {crew|Porta|Porta|Portate} anche lei!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Aunt Gerd: My chests! Careful, the blue one has my grandmother's spoons."
msgstr "Zia Gerd: I miei bauli! Attenzione, in quello blu ci sono i cucchiai di mia nonna."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My sister! And my chests! You are good girls. The sunny hill is yours: plant something beautiful "
"on it."
msgstr ""
"Mia sorella! E i miei bauli! {crew|Sei un bravo ragazzo|Sei una brava ragazza|Siete bravi "
"ragazzi|Siete brave ragazze}. La collina al sole è {crew|tua|tua|vostra}: "
"{crew|seminaci|seminaci|seminateci} qualcosa di bello."

