"La terra di una famiglia passava dalla mamma e dal papà ai figli; anche le donne potevano "
"possedere terra."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/072_a_flock_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Flock of Our Own"
msgstr "Un gregge tutto nostro"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/072_a_flock_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The sunny hill has the best grass. Let us have a real flock: five sheep! Buy them at the market or"
" from Sten's herders."
msgstr ""
"La collina al sole ha l'erba migliore. Facciamo un vero gregge: cinque pecore! "
"{crew|Comprale|Comprale|Compratele} al mercato o dai pastori di Sten."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/072_a_flock_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Five sheep on the hill, like white clouds. We will have wool for the whole family!"
msgstr "Cinque pecore sulla collina, come nuvole bianche. Avremo lana per tutta la famiglia!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/072_a_flock_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sheep gave wool, milk, meat and skins; nothing was wasted."
msgstr "Le pecore davano lana, latte, carne e pelli; non si sprecava niente."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/073_the_bear_comes_back/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Bear Comes Back"
msgstr "L'orso ritorna"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/073_the_bear_comes_back/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Honey is missing again! But this time, the paw prints are BIG. Ask Inga the messenger, she rows "
"past the woods every day."
msgstr ""
"Manca di nuovo il miele! Ma questa volta le impronte sono GRANDI. {crew|Chiedi|Chiedi|Chiedete} a "
"Inga la messaggera: passa in barca vicino al bosco ogni giorno."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/073_the_bear_comes_back/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A young bear by the woods of Hjortingsala, with a white spot on his chest. The cub you carried, "
"all grown up!"
msgstr ""
"Un giovane orso vicino al bosco di Hjortingsala, con una macchia bianca sul petto. L'orsetto che "
"{crew|hai|hai|avete} portato, ormai cresciuto!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/073_the_bear_comes_back/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I put the pots by the old oak. Look! He comes out of the bushes and sniffs. He remembers you!"
msgstr ""
"Ho messo i vasi vicino alla vecchia quercia. {crew|Guarda|Guarda|Guardate}! Esce dai cespugli e "
"annusa. Si ricorda di {crew|te|te|voi}!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/073_the_bear_comes_back/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Then he gets honey of his own, far from my hives. Take him two pots."
msgstr ""
"Allora avrà il suo miele, lontano dalle mie arnie. {crew|Portagliene|Portagliene|Portategliene} "
"due vasi."

