#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/074_a_striped_sail/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Striped Sail"
msgstr "Una vela a strisce"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/074_a_striped_sail/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your boat has a dragon head, but no sail. I will weave you a little one, with red and white "
"stripes. Bring me six crates of wool, and give me two nights."
msgstr ""
"La {crew|tua|tua|vostra} barca ha una testa di drago, ma niente vela. {crew|Te|Te|Ve} ne tesserò "
"una piccola, a strisce rosse e bianche. {crew|Portami|Portami|Portatemi} sei casse di lana, e "
"{crew|dammi|dammi|datemi} due notti."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/074_a_striped_sail/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now the looms clatter. Come back in two days!"
msgstr "Ora i telai sbattono. {crew|Torna|Torna|Tornate} tra due giorni!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/074_a_striped_sail/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Red and white stripes, like the great ships! It is small, but on a windy day it helps your arms."
msgstr ""
"Strisce rosse e bianche, come le grandi navi! È piccola, ma nei giorni di vento aiuta le "
"{crew|tue|tue|vostre} braccia."

#. a gift for a task: 'You get ...'
#: data/missions/074_a_striped_sail/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "a striped sail"
msgstr "una vela a strisce"

