#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/074_a_striped_sail/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A big viking sail took a weaver years; it was worth as much as the ship."
msgstr "A una tessitrice servivano anni per una grande vela vichinga; valeva quanto la nave."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/075_the_widest_hold/mission.json
