#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/075_the_widest_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Last time, I promise! Six oak branches from Frosttorp, four boxes of rivets from Hrafn, and 40 "
"silver: your hold takes two more crates, whatever ship you row."
msgstr ""
"L'ultima volta, lo prometto! Sei rami di quercia da Frosttorp, quattro scatole di rivetti da "
"Hrafn, e 40 argento: la {crew|tua|tua|vostra} stiva porterà due casse in più, su qualunque nave "
"{crew|remi|remi|remiate}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/075_the_widest_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Rivets for Bjarne? He must love you two."
msgstr "Rivetti per Bjarne? {crew|Ti|Ti|Vi} vorrà proprio bene."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/075_the_widest_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Two more crates! Now your hold is the widest on the lakes. Now go and trade like the big ships."
msgstr ""
"Due casse in più! Ora la {crew|tua|tua|vostra} stiva è la più larga dei laghi. Ora "
"{crew|va'|va'|andate} a commerciare come le grandi navi."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
