#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/076_a_wedding_at_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Wedding at Frosttorp"
msgstr "Nozze a Frosttorp"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/076_a_wedding_at_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My daughter Ingrid marries Arne's son Kol in Frosttorp! Row her there in your painted boat, with "
"her three chests of dowry. Within two days!"
msgstr ""
"Mia figlia Ingrid sposa Kol, il figlio di Arne, a Frosttorp! {crew|Portala|Portala|Portatela} lì "
"con la {crew|tua|tua|vostra} barca dipinta, con i suoi tre bauli di dote. Entro due giorni!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/076_a_wedding_at_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The dowry! Now the bride."
msgstr "La dote! Ora la sposa."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/076_a_wedding_at_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Linen, a loom and silver spoons: everything for a new home."
msgstr "Lino, un telaio e cucchiai d'argento: tutto per una casa nuova."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/076_a_wedding_at_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here comes the bride! Kol is red as a beet. Come, the feast begins!"
msgstr ""
"Ecco la sposa! Kol è rosso come una barbabietola. {crew|Vieni|Vieni|Venite}, la festa comincia!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/076_a_wedding_at_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "In the boat with the dragon head! Everybody will look at me."
msgstr "Sulla barca con la testa di drago! Tutti mi guarderanno."

