msgid "Grandma's Birthday"
msgstr "Il compleanno della nonna"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/080_grandmothers_birthday/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Psst! Your grandmother turns seventy in two days. A surprise: a new shawl from Sæunn, a cake from "
"Gudrun, and me as a guest. Do not tell her!"
msgstr ""
"Psst! Tra due giorni {crew|tua|tua|vostra} nonna compie settant'anni. Una sorpresa: uno scialle "
"nuovo da Sæunn, una torta da Gudrun, e io come ospite. Non {crew|dirglielo|dirglielo|diteglielo}!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/080_grandmothers_birthday/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Blue, like her eyes. Hide it under the hay!"
