#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/080_grandmothers_birthday/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey cake with seventy almonds. I counted!"
msgstr "Torta al miele con settanta mandorle. Le ho contate!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/080_grandmothers_birthday/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A shawl? A cake? Tova? Oh, my girls... Seventy years, and this is my happiest birthday."
msgstr ""
"Uno scialle? Una torta? Tova? Oh, {crew|nipote mio|nipote mia|nipoti miei|nipoti mie}... "
"Settant'anni, e questo è il mio compleanno più felice."

