#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Healers' Round"
msgstr "Il giro dei guaritori"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You are ready. Do my round alone today: look at the lambs in Ålberga, the horses in Torsgården and"
" the swans in Svanetorp. Then come and tell me."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Sei pronto|Sei pronta|Siete pronti|Siete pronte}. Oggi {crew|fai|fai|fate} il mio giro da "
"{crew|solo|sola|soli|sole}: {crew|controlla|controlla|controllate} gli agnelli a Ålberga, i "
"cavalli a Torsgården e i cigni a Svanetorp. Poi {crew|vieni|vieni|venite} a raccontarmelo."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "You look in their eyes, their ears, their hooves... All well? Good! They like you."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Guardi|Guardi|Guardate} gli occhi, le orecchie, gli zoccoli... Tutto bene? Bene! "
"{crew|Ti|Ti|Vi} vogliono bene."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bror is old, but well. Silke's new foal is strong. Tell Tova all is fine."
msgstr ""
"Bror è vecchio, ma sta bene. Il nuovo puledro di Silke è forte. {crew|Di'|Di'|Dite} a Tova che va "
"tutto bene."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The swans? Fat and happy. One has a sore wing: you wrapped it well."
msgstr ""
"I cigni? Grassi e felici. Uno aveva un'ala dolorante: {crew|l'hai fasciata|l'hai fasciata|l'avete "
"fasciata} bene."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"All well, and the swan's wing wrapped? Then take this: your own healer's bag. You are healers now."
msgstr ""
"Tutto bene, e l'ala del cigno fasciata? Allora {crew|prendi|prendi|prendete} questa: la "
"{crew|tua|tua|vostra} borsa da {crew|guaritore|guaritrice|guaritori|guaritrici}. Ora {crew|sei un "
"guaritore|sei una guaritrice|siete guaritori|siete guaritrici}."

#. a gift for a task: 'You get ...'
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "your own healer's bag"
msgstr "la {crew|tua|tua|vostra} borsa da {crew|guaritore|guaritrice|guaritori|guaritrici}"

#. the thing 'your own healer's bag' for {thing@acc} in the translations: the accusative (the direct
