#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Winter Stores"
msgstr "Le scorte d'inverno"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Autumn again! Before the lakes freeze, fill the store: ten crates of hay and six of grain, within "
"three days. You know how by now!"
msgstr ""
"Di nuovo autunno! Prima che i laghi gelino, {crew|riempi|riempi|riempite} il magazzino: dieci "
"casse di fieno e sei di grano, entro tre giorni. Ormai {crew|sai|sai|sapete} come fare!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay for all our animals. Now the grain."
msgstr "Fieno per tutti i nostri animali. Ora il grano."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The store is full to the roof! Not one animal will be hungry this winter."
msgstr "Il magazzino è pieno fino al tetto! Quest'inverno nessun animale avrà fame."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Autumn was the busiest time: everything for the long winter had to be in."
msgstr ""
"L'autunno era il periodo più indaffarato: tutto per il lungo inverno doveva essere al riparo."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fish for Every Farm"
