#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our best catch ever! Bring three bundles of dried fish to each farm: Frosttorp, Solby and "
"Svanetorp. A gift from Stormvik, for the winter."
msgstr ""
"La nostra pesca migliore di sempre! {crew|Porta|Porta|Portate} tre fagotti di pesce secco a ogni "
"fattoria: Frosttorp, Solby e Svanetorp. Un regalo da Stormvik, per l'inverno."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "From Tor? What a neighbour!"
msgstr "Da Tor? Che vicino!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fish for the winter! Tell Tor: apples for him in spring."
msgstr "Pesce per l'inverno! {crew|Di'|Di'|Dite} a Tor: in primavera avrà le mele."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fish? For an old man? Tor is a good boy. Thank you!"
