#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Invitations"
msgstr "Gli inviti"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We hold a feast here on the farm, for all our friends! Invite them: hail three boats on the lakes,"
" and visit Tova and Ragnfrid."
msgstr ""
"Facciamo una festa qui alla fattoria, per tutti i nostri amici! "
"{crew|Invitali|Invitali|Invitateli}: {crew|saluta|saluta|salutate} tre barche sui laghi, e "
"{crew|va'|va'|andate} a trovare Tova e Ragnfrid."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast? Of course! I will tell everybody on the lakes."
msgstr "Una festa? Certo! Lo dirò a tutti sui laghi."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast at your farm? We come, and bring our fiddle!"
msgstr "Una festa alla {crew|tua|tua|vostra} fattoria? Veniamo, e portiamo il violino!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Count on me! I bring my best fish."
msgstr "{crew|Conta|Conta|Contate} su di me! Porto il mio pesce migliore."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "I would not miss it! I come with my herb wine."
msgstr "Non me la perderei mai! Vengo con il mio vino alle erbe."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "We come with all the horses! Silke wants to see her daughter."
msgstr "Veniamo con tutti i cavalli! Silke vuole vedere sua figlia."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A great feast could last a week, with guests from every farm around."
msgstr "Una grande festa poteva durare una settimana, con ospiti da tutte le fattorie intorno."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Food for the Feast"
msgstr "Cibo per la festa"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"So many guests! Bring four crates of mead, four of ale and four of cheese. Twelve crates: your big"
" boat can do it, but you must buy well."
msgstr ""
"Quanti ospiti! {crew|Porta|Porta|Portate} quattro casse di idromele, quattro di birra e quattro di"
" formaggio. Dodici casse: la {crew|tua|tua|vostra} barca grande ce la fa, ma "
"{crew|devi|devi|dovete} comprare bene."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mead! Now the ale."
msgstr "Idromele! Ora la birra."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ale! Now the cheese."
msgstr "Birra! Ora il formaggio."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Everything is ready: the tables, the torches, the food. Now only the guests!"
msgstr "È tutto pronto: i tavoli, le torce, il cibo. Mancano solo gli ospiti!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "At a feast, the host gave the best food and drink: being generous brought honour."
msgstr ""
"A una festa chi ospitava offriva il cibo e le bevande migliori: essere generosi portava onore."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Feast at the Farm"
msgstr "La festa alla fattoria"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The guests come! But some have no boat: bring Old Grim from Svanetorp, Old Halvard from Solby, and"
" Tova from her island. Then the feast begins!"
msgstr ""
"Arrivano gli ospiti! Ma alcuni non hanno la barca: {crew|porta|porta|portate} il vecchio Grim da "
"Svanetorp, il vecchio Halvard da Solby, e Tova dalla sua isola. Poi la festa comincia!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Welcome, Grim!"
msgstr "Benvenuto, Grim!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast for an old man? I bring my cow's best butter!"
msgstr "Una festa per un vecchio? Porto il burro migliore della mia mucca!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Welcome, Halvard!"
msgstr "Benvenuto, Halvard!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "One more trip with my favourite skippers! Did I tell you about the sea serpent?"
msgstr ""
"Un altro viaggio con {crew|il mio capitano preferito|la mia capitana preferita|i miei capitani "
"preferiti|le mie capitane preferite}! {crew|Ti ho|Ti ho|Vi ho} già raccontato del serpente marino?"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My apprentices, healers now, and rowing me to a feast. I am proud of you."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Il mio apprendista, ora guaritore, che mi porta|La mia apprendista, ora guaritrice, che mi "
"porta|I miei apprendisti, ora guaritori, che mi portano|Le mie apprendiste, ora guaritrici, che mi"
" portano} in barca a una festa. Sono fiera di {crew|te|te|voi}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Everybody is here: the people and the animals of all the lakes, music and torches and songs. Look "
"what you made of an old boat, three hens and a sheep."
msgstr ""
"Ci sono tutti: le persone e gli animali di tutti i laghi, musica, torce e canzoni. "
"{crew|Guarda|Guarda|Guardate} cosa {crew|hai|hai|avete} fatto di una vecchia barca, tre galline e "
"una pecora."

